---
import Variant from '../../layouts/Variant.astro';
---

<Variant
  title="ExCSV storage forms"
  description="Overview of ExCSV document profiles: plain inline, sidecar metadata, ZIP container, and pack format."
  heading="Storage forms"
  lede="ExCSV is one format with several ways to ship it. Pick the profile that matches how your data is stored on disk."
>
  <div class="format-grid">
    <div class="format-card">
      <span class="badge badge-stable">v0.3</span>
      <h3><a href="/variants/plain/">Plain (inline)</a></h3>
      <p>Metadata and data rows in a single <code>.excsv</code> or <code>.extsv</code> file. The canonical form.</p>
      <a href="/variants/plain/">Read more →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="format-card">
      <span class="badge badge-stable">v0.3</span>
      <h3><a href="/variants/sidecar/">Sidecar</a></h3>
      <p>Schema and stats in <code>sales.excsv</code> or <code>sales.extsv</code>; rows stay in <code>sales.csv</code> or <code>sales.tsv</code>. Legacy CSV/TSV friendly.</p>
      <a href="/variants/sidecar/">Read more →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="format-card">
      <span class="badge badge-stable">v0.3</span>
      <h3><a href="/variants/zip/">ZIP container</a></h3>
      <p>One inner <code>.excsv</code> or <code>.extsv</code> inside <code>.excsv.zip</code> or <code>.extsv.zip</code>. Summary in the ZIP comment.</p>
      <a href="/variants/zip/">Read more →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="format-card">
      <span class="badge badge-stable">v0.3</span>
      <h3><a href="/variants/pack/">Pack</a></h3>
      <p>Manifest + per-table <code>.col</code> columns. Multi-table snapshots and selective column reads.</p>
      <a href="/variants/pack/">Read more →</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2>How they relate</h2>
  <pre><code>plain (inline)     sales.excsv | sales.extsv     header + meta + data rows
sidecar            sales.excsv + sales.csv         meta only + reference=
                   sales.extsv + sales.tsv
zip                sales.excsv.zip | sales.extsv.zip   inner file (usually inline)
pack               dataset.excsv.pack.zip            manifest + .col columns</code></pre>

  <p>
    Normative rules live in the <a href="/spec/">specification</a>.
    Sidecar: <a href="/spec/#sidecar">§2.3</a>.
    Row ZIP: <a href="/spec/#zip-container">§10</a>.
    Pack: <a href="/spec/#pack-container">§10.5</a>.
  </p>
</Variant>
